{
  "$Comment": [
    "A chain of waves players clear one after another, each raised by Zc_Wave_Rise. Run it in a",
    "state's Instructions (or hand it to a base script's slot, such as a guard wave the boss waits",
    "on); while it runs it holds PendingFlag, so a boss gated on that flag rises only once the chain",
    "is done:",
    "",
    "  { \"Reference\": \"Zc_Wave_Chain\",",
    "    \"Modify\": { \"Role\": \"Skeleton_Fighter\", \"FarRole\": \"Skeleton_Archer\", \"Waves\": 3,",
    "                \"Groups\": [ \"Skeleton\" ], \"PendingFlag\": \"My_Boss_Waits\" } }",
    "",
    "In order. A player comes within PlayerRange of the script's entity and Delay starts (long enough",
    "for an arrival's intro camera to end). The first wave rises (Zc_Wave_Rise: the near and far",
    "rows, Signal, and Moment with the wave count). Once one of them is seen and none of Groups is",
    "left alive within Range, the wave is cleared and the chain beats zc:cleared; if none is ever seen",
    "(every spot blocked), it counts as cleared after WatchSeconds, so a failed spawn never holds the",
    "chain. Gap seconds after a clear the next wave rises, until the run has counted Waves clears;",
    "then DoneFlag goes up and PendingFlag comes down. Players who fall mid-wave come back to the same",
    "wave: nothing here resets on a death.",
    "",
    "The count is the library's own reading of the run (ziggfreedcommon:encounter_waves_cleared, every",
    "zc:cleared beat the run has heard), so run the chain before anything else in the fight beats",
    "zc:cleared. Signal is only what each rise announces, a wave beat by default. It fails open rather",
    "than looping: a script the library keeps no run for ends the chain after its first wave, so a",
    "fight the library does not follow still lets its boss rise.",
    "",
    "Every flag and timer is named in the Parameters, so give each chain in a script its own names.",
    "To raise the chain again (after a fight's reset, say), clear DoneFlag, WaitingFlag, UpFlag,",
    "SeenFlag and ClearedFlag; a DoneFlag nothing clears keeps the chain beaten for as long as the",
    "script's entity stands, through every reset of its fight."
  ],
  "Class": "Instruction",
  "Type": "Component",
  "Interface": "Hytale.Instruction.Encounter.Phase.Behavior",
  "Parameters": {
    "Role": {
      "Value": "Skeleton_Fighter",
      "Description": "The creature each wave's near row raises."
    },
    "FarRole": {
      "Value": "Skeleton_Archer",
      "Description": "The creature each wave's far row raises. Give it Role for waves of one kind."
    },
    "Waves": {
      "Value": 3,
      "Description": "How many waves rise, 1 or more: the chain ends once the run has counted this many clears."
    },
    "NearCount": {
      "Value": [ 2, 2 ],
      "Description": "How many rise in each near row, as a [min, max] range of 1 or more."
    },
    "NearAngle": {
      "Value": 60,
      "Description": "Degrees the near row spreads across, centred on the way the script's entity faces."
    },
    "NearDistance": {
      "Value": [ 6, 6 ],
      "Description": "Blocks from the script's entity to the near row."
    },
    "FarCount": {
      "Value": [ 1, 1 ],
      "Description": "How many rise in each far row, as a [min, max] range of 1 or more."
    },
    "FarAngle": {
      "Value": 30,
      "Description": "Degrees the far row spreads across, centred on the way the script's entity faces."
    },
    "FarDistance": {
      "Value": [ 12, 12 ],
      "Description": "Blocks from the script's entity to the far row."
    },
    "Groups": {
      "Value": [ "Skeleton" ],
      "TypeHint": "String",
      "Description": "NPC groups holding Role and FarRole: while one of them lives within Range, the wave is not cleared. Sweep them when the fight resets."
    },
    "Range": {
      "Value": 40,
      "Description": "How far from the script's entity a living creature of Groups keeps its wave going. Cover the whole arena."
    },
    "PlayerRange": {
      "Value": 40,
      "Description": "How close to the script's entity a player must come to start the chain."
    },
    "Delay": {
      "Value": [ 3, 3 ],
      "Description": "Seconds from the first player in PlayerRange to the first wave."
    },
    "Gap": {
      "Value": [ 4, 4 ],
      "Description": "Seconds from a wave's last creature falling to the next wave."
    },
    "WatchSeconds": {
      "Value": [ 3, 3 ],
      "Description": "Seconds a wave waits to see one of its creatures before it counts as cleared anyway."
    },
    "Signal": {
      "Value": "zc:wave",
      "Description": "The beat sent as each wave rises: zc:wave, or zc:wave:<label>. The chain counts its clears, never this beat."
    },
    "Moment": {
      "Value": "",
      "Description": "The FeedbackMoment each member is shown as a wave rises, carrying the wave count as wave. Empty shows nothing."
    },
    "PendingFlag": {
      "Value": "Zc_Wave_Chain_Pending",
      "Description": "Set while the chain runs and lowered when it is done: gate a boss's rise on it being unset."
    },
    "DoneFlag": {
      "Value": "Zc_Wave_Chain_Done",
      "Description": "Set once the last wave is cleared. While it is set the chain does nothing."
    },
    "WaitingFlag": {
      "Value": "Zc_Wave_Chain_Waiting",
      "Description": "Set once a player has come within PlayerRange."
    },
    "UpFlag": {
      "Value": "Zc_Wave_Chain_Up",
      "Description": "Set while a wave stands."
    },
    "SeenFlag": {
      "Value": "Zc_Wave_Chain_Seen",
      "Description": "Set once one of the standing wave's creatures is seen."
    },
    "ClearedFlag": {
      "Value": "Zc_Wave_Chain_Cleared",
      "Description": "Set from a wave's clear until the next wave rises."
    },
    "DelayTimer": {
      "Value": "Zc_Wave_Chain_Delay",
      "Description": "The timer behind Delay."
    },
    "WatchTimer": {
      "Value": "Zc_Wave_Chain_Watch",
      "Description": "The timer behind WatchSeconds."
    },
    "GapTimer": {
      "Value": "Zc_Wave_Chain_Gap",
      "Description": "The timer behind Gap."
    }
  },
  "Content": {
    "Continue": true,
    "Sensor": {
      "Type": "Any"
    },
    "Instructions": [
      {
        "$Comment": "Until the chain is done it holds PendingFlag: claimed before anything rises.",
        "Continue": true,
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "Flag",
          "Name": { "Compute": "DoneFlag" },
          "Set": false
        },
        "Actions": [
          {
            "Type": "SetFlag",
            "Name": { "Compute": "PendingFlag" }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "A player arrives: the wait before the first wave starts.",
        "Continue": true,
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "And",
          "Sensors": [
            {
              "Type": "Flag",
              "Name": { "Compute": "DoneFlag" },
              "Set": false
            },
            {
              "Type": "Flag",
              "Name": { "Compute": "WaitingFlag" },
              "Set": false
            },
            {
              "Type": "Player",
              "Range": { "Compute": "PlayerRange" }
            }
          ]
        },
        "Actions": [
          {
            "Type": "SetFlag",
            "Name": { "Compute": "WaitingFlag" }
          },
          {
            "$Comment": "A timer starts only once in the script's life, so it is re-armed with TimerRestart.",
            "Type": "TimerStart",
            "Name": { "Compute": "DelayTimer" },
            "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "Delay" },
            "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "Delay" },
            "Repeating": false
          },
          {
            "Type": "TimerRestart",
            "Name": { "Compute": "DelayTimer" }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "A wave rises: the first once Delay runs out, each next once Gap runs out after a clear. The watch for it starts.",
        "Continue": true,
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "And",
          "Sensors": [
            {
              "Type": "Flag",
              "Name": { "Compute": "DoneFlag" },
              "Set": false
            },
            {
              "Type": "Flag",
              "Name": { "Compute": "WaitingFlag" }
            },
            {
              "Type": "Flag",
              "Name": { "Compute": "UpFlag" },
              "Set": false
            },
            {
              "Type": "Or",
              "Sensors": [
                {
                  "Type": "And",
                  "Sensors": [
                    {
                      "Type": "Flag",
                      "Name": { "Compute": "ClearedFlag" },
                      "Set": false
                    },
                    {
                      "Type": "Timer",
                      "Name": { "Compute": "DelayTimer" },
                      "State": "Stopped"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "Type": "And",
                  "Sensors": [
                    {
                      "Type": "Flag",
                      "Name": { "Compute": "ClearedFlag" }
                    },
                    {
                      "Type": "Timer",
                      "Name": { "Compute": "GapTimer" },
                      "State": "Stopped"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "Instructions": [
          {
            "Continue": true,
            "Reference": "Zc_Wave_Rise",
            "Modify": {
              "Role": { "Compute": "Role" },
              "FarRole": { "Compute": "FarRole" },
              "NearCount": { "Compute": "NearCount" },
              "NearAngle": { "Compute": "NearAngle" },
              "NearDistance": { "Compute": "NearDistance" },
              "FarCount": { "Compute": "FarCount" },
              "FarAngle": { "Compute": "FarAngle" },
              "FarDistance": { "Compute": "FarDistance" },
              "Signal": { "Compute": "Signal" },
              "Moment": { "Compute": "Moment" }
            }
          },
          {
            "Sensor": {
              "Type": "Any"
            },
            "Actions": [
              {
                "Type": "SetFlag",
                "Name": { "Compute": "UpFlag" }
              },
              {
                "Type": "SetFlag",
                "Name": { "Compute": "SeenFlag" },
                "SetTo": false
              },
              {
                "Type": "SetFlag",
                "Name": { "Compute": "ClearedFlag" },
                "SetTo": false
              },
              {
                "Type": "TimerStart",
                "Name": { "Compute": "WatchTimer" },
                "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "WatchSeconds" },
                "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "WatchSeconds" },
                "Repeating": false
              },
              {
                "Type": "TimerRestart",
                "Name": { "Compute": "WatchTimer" }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "One of the standing wave is seen.",
        "Continue": true,
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "And",
          "Sensors": [
            {
              "Type": "Flag",
              "Name": { "Compute": "DoneFlag" },
              "Set": false
            },
            {
              "Type": "Flag",
              "Name": { "Compute": "UpFlag" }
            },
            {
              "Type": "Flag",
              "Name": { "Compute": "SeenFlag" },
              "Set": false
            },
            {
              "Type": "Mob",
              "Range": { "Compute": "Range" },
              "Filters": [
                {
                  "Type": "NPCGroup",
                  "IncludeGroups": { "Compute": "Groups" }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "Actions": [
          {
            "Type": "SetFlag",
            "Name": { "Compute": "SeenFlag" }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "The wave is cleared (none left alive, or none ever seen once the watch runs out) and the run's count says more are to come: the clear is beaten and the Gap starts. The count reads the clears before this one, so more are to come while it reads below Waves - 1.",
        "Continue": true,
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "And",
          "Sensors": [
            {
              "Type": "Flag",
              "Name": { "Compute": "DoneFlag" },
              "Set": false
            },
            {
              "Type": "Flag",
              "Name": { "Compute": "UpFlag" }
            },
            {
              "Type": "Or",
              "Sensors": [
                {
                  "Type": "Flag",
                  "Name": { "Compute": "SeenFlag" }
                },
                {
                  "Type": "Timer",
                  "Name": { "Compute": "WatchTimer" },
                  "State": "Stopped"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Type": "Not",
              "Sensor": {
                "Type": "Mob",
                "Range": { "Compute": "Range" },
                "Filters": [
                  {
                    "Type": "NPCGroup",
                    "IncludeGroups": { "Compute": "Groups" }
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "Type": "ZigFactor",
              "Factor": "ziggfreedcommon:encounter_waves_cleared",
              "Value": [ 0, 1000000 ]
            },
            {
              "Type": "Not",
              "Sensor": {
                "Type": "ZigFactor",
                "Factor": "ziggfreedcommon:encounter_waves_cleared",
                "Value": { "Compute": "[Waves - 1, 1000000]" }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "Actions": [
          {
            "Type": "SignalWorldEvent",
            "SignalId": "zc:cleared"
          },
          {
            "Type": "SetFlag",
            "Name": { "Compute": "UpFlag" },
            "SetTo": false
          },
          {
            "Type": "SetFlag",
            "Name": { "Compute": "ClearedFlag" }
          },
          {
            "Type": "TimerStart",
            "Name": { "Compute": "GapTimer" },
            "StartValueRange": { "Compute": "Gap" },
            "RestartValueRange": { "Compute": "Gap" },
            "Repeating": false
          },
          {
            "Type": "TimerRestart",
            "Name": { "Compute": "GapTimer" }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "$Comment": "The wave is cleared and no more are to come (this clear is the last of Waves, or there is no count to read): the clear is beaten, and the chain is done and lets go of PendingFlag.",
        "Continue": true,
        "Sensor": {
          "Type": "And",
          "Sensors": [
            {
              "Type": "Flag",
              "Name": { "Compute": "DoneFlag" },
              "Set": false
            },
            {
              "Type": "Flag",
              "Name": { "Compute": "UpFlag" }
            },
            {
              "Type": "Or",
              "Sensors": [
                {
                  "Type": "Flag",
                  "Name": { "Compute": "SeenFlag" }
                },
                {
                  "Type": "Timer",
                  "Name": { "Compute": "WatchTimer" },
                  "State": "Stopped"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Type": "Not",
              "Sensor": {
                "Type": "Mob",
                "Range": { "Compute": "Range" },
                "Filters": [
                  {
                    "Type": "NPCGroup",
                    "IncludeGroups": { "Compute": "Groups" }
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "Type": "Or",
              "Sensors": [
                {
                  "Type": "Not",
                  "Sensor": {
                    "Type": "ZigFactor",
                    "Factor": "ziggfreedcommon:encounter_waves_cleared",
                    "Value": [ 0, 1000000 ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "Type": "ZigFactor",
                  "Factor": "ziggfreedcommon:encounter_waves_cleared",
                  "Value": { "Compute": "[Waves - 1, 1000000]" }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "Actions": [
          {
            "Type": "SignalWorldEvent",
            "SignalId": "zc:cleared"
          },
          {
            "Type": "SetFlag",
            "Name": { "Compute": "DoneFlag" }
          },
          {
            "Type": "SetFlag",
            "Name": { "Compute": "PendingFlag" },
            "SetTo": false
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
